# Build-context exclusions for `docker build` / docker compose.
#
# Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so anything not listed here ends up in an image
# layer — including .env, which holds the LLM key, the session signing key and
# the storage DSN. Compose injects those at runtime instead (env_file: .env).

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS / editor
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea

# Python build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Local environments and runtime state
.venv/
venv/
data/
*.log
*.pid
